WEBVTT

42:41.842 --> 42:43.843
They're cannibals.

42:47.014 --> 42:48.181
Mayday, mayday.

42:48.265 --> 42:50.516
Come in, Star Command.
Send reinforcements.

42:50.601 --> 42:52.936
Star Command, do you copy?

42:53.354 --> 42:55.772
I've set my laser from stun to kill.

42:55.856 --> 43:00.026
Great. Great. Yeah, and if anyone
attacks us, we can blink 'em to death.
